<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss money market stable, trend seen continuing.</title>
<headline>Swiss money market stable, trend seen continuing.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss money market rates were steady with overnight and tomorrow next money quoted just below two percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) was seen in the market this morning conducting routine operations to keep liquidity flowing and dealers see no signs of this trend changing, giving the current weak Swiss economic climate.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is very steady right now,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
